{"id":"n64382-2-7","stage":3,"title":"성숙 · 成熟","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64382-2-7-1","ko":"어른이 된다는 것은 어떤 것일까?","zh":"长大到底意味着什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른이","meaning":"成年人，大人","explanation":"어른：成年人，大人；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"1","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어른이","audio":"/audio/a7c77c50224e28b02ae1.mp3"}},{"text":"된다는","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된다는","audio":"/audio/88ed995d47a01322aaf6.mp3"}},{"text":"것은","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것은","audio":"/audio/66faf3bab33879865298.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"것일까?","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것일까","audio":"/audio/1e28961155212325eff2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"成年人，大人","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"长大成人的人。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。；表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2df31b27c6f8e47a7e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64382-2-7-2","ko":"단순히 몸이 자라는 것뿐 아니라 지적 성숙도 함께해야겠지.","zh":"不仅仅是身体成长，智力上的成熟也同样重要吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"단순히","meaning":"简单地，单一地","explanation":"단순히：简单地，单一地","readings":[{"term":"단순히","audio":"/audio/e1b9375992f8cec6357a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42218","senseId":"1","lemma":"단순히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단순히","audio":"/audio/e1b9375992f8cec6357a.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"자라는","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자라는","audio":"/audio/2ced5f42cf8bcacc0205.mp3"}},{"text":"것뿐","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；뿐：限定范围，表示“只有、仅仅”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것뿐","audio":"/audio/e383127f13e0f541857c.mp3"}},{"text":"아니라","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"아니라","audio":"/audio/1a1abd38241aca48f9a0.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니라","audio":"/audio/1a1abd38241aca48f9a0.mp3"}},{"text":"지적","meaning":"知识的，理性的","explanation":"지적：知识的，理性的","readings":[{"term":"지적","audio":"/audio/b0c373a7418c7255f1bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28414","senseId":"1","lemma":"지적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지적","audio":"/audio/b0c373a7418c7255f1bc.mp3"}},{"text":"성숙도","meaning":"成熟","explanation":"성숙：成熟；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"성숙","audio":"/audio/cd25cae075126ebee791.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64382","senseId":"2","lemma":"성숙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성숙도","audio":"/audio/04e6431b8d2664743a2f.mp3"}},{"text":"함께해야겠지.","meaning":"一起来，一起做，共同","explanation":"함께하다：一起来，一起做，共同；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"함께하다","audio":"/audio/cfbe25f214eb09b4652c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84261","senseId":"1","lemma":"함께하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함께해야겠지","audio":"/audio/8fd75a5d3945415cb55c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e1b9375992f8cec6","term":"단순히","zh":"简单地，单一地","audio":"/audio/e1b9375992f8cec6357a.mp3","entryId":"42218","definition":"简单不复杂地。","pronunciation":["단순히"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciatio